### Runs where your data lives {.pbh-heading}

Pointblank works through [Narwhals](https://narwhals-dev.github.io/narwhals/) and
[Ibis](https://ibis-project.org), so the same plan runs unchanged on DataFrames and in databases,
and the checks happen where the data is.

::: {.pbh-backends}
[Polars]{.pbh-backend}
[Pandas]{.pbh-backend}
[PyArrow]{.pbh-backend}
[DuckDB]{.pbh-backend}
[PySpark]{.pbh-backend}
[Snowflake]{.pbh-backend}
[BigQuery]{.pbh-backend}
[Databricks]{.pbh-backend}
[PostgreSQL]{.pbh-backend}
[MySQL]{.pbh-backend}
[SQL Server]{.pbh-backend}
[SQLite]{.pbh-backend}
[CSV and Parquet]{.pbh-backend}
:::

[Installation](/user-guide/getting-started/installation.qmd){.pbh-more}

### And when you need more {.pbh-heading}

Validation is the core, and everything else builds on it.

:::: {.pbh-cards}

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-file-earmark-check"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Contracts and pipelines

Reusable data contracts, checked where data comes in and where it goes out. Import JSON Schema and
Frictionless.

[Data contracts →](/user-guide/contracts-and-pipelines/contracts.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-terminal"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### YAML and the CLI

Keep plans in YAML for review, and run them with `pb` in CI, with exit codes and extracts.

[YAML workflows →](/user-guide/yaml/yaml-validation-workflows.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-stars"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Plans drafted by AI

Get a first plan from a model that looked at your table, then revise it in plain English.

[Drafting plans →](/user-guide/advanced-validation/draft-validation.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-layout-split"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Comparing tables

Find the rows and values that differ between two tables, even across backends and large files.

[Comparing tables →](/user-guide/table-comparison/comparing-tables.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-cpu"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Data for machine learning

Check training splits, synthetic data, and text, then measure which failing rows hurt a model.

[Data ablation →](/user-guide/post-interrogation/data-ablation.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-search"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Look before you validate

Previews, column summaries, and missing-value maps to see what a table holds.

[Data inspection →](/user-guide/data-inspection/preview.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-magic"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Test data

Generate realistic data from a schema, in 100+ locales, as a pytest fixture.

[Generating test data →](/user-guide/test-data-generation/generating-test-data.qmd)
:::

::: {.pbh-card}
[<i class="bi bi-heart-pulse"></i>]{.pbh-card-icon}

##### Clinical and metadata standards

CDISC SDTM and ADaM, Define-XML, and metadata from SPSS, SAS, and Stata files.

[Metadata import →](/user-guide/metadata-import/metadata-import.qmd)
