### Get started {.pbh-heading}

:::: {.pbh-start}

::: {.pbh-start-text}
Install Pointblank from PyPI:

```bash
pip install pointblank
```

Then make your first validation in the
[Quickstart](/user-guide/getting-started/quickstart.qmd), or look through the
[Demos](/examples/) for ideas. Reports come in
[40 languages](/user-guide/post-interrogation/validation-reports.qmd#reports-in-other-languages).
